abstract: >-
  Research artifact accompanying the GTAA-LM paper accepted at SBCARS 2026.
  The artifact provides the microservices proof of concept, controlled diagnostic
  tools, observability infrastructure, governance and traceability mechanisms,
  fault-injection scenarios, evaluation scripts, and experimental outputs used
  to instantiate and evaluate the proposed architecture.
